    kind note;
    locator "section/6724/note/6";
    text en official """Effective Date of 2022 Amendment
Amendment by section 323(c) of Pub. L. 117–328 applicable to transfers, rollovers, and exchanges occurring after Dec. 31, 2023, see section 323(e) of Pub. L. 117–328, set out as a note under section 72 of this title.
